{"topicSections":[{"title":"Type Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SupportedVersions\/isSwiftSixLanguageMode","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SupportedVersions\/minimumSwiftToolsVersion","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SupportedVersions\/newestTestedSwift"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Properties"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/supportedversions"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"SupportedVersions","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The floor enforces itself: SwiftPM reads "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swift-tools-version"},{"type":"text","text":" before it resolves"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"anything, and an older toolchain refuses the package outright with a clear message.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Nothing enforces the upper end — a package resolves and builds on a newer toolchain","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whether or not anybody ever compiled it there, and the differences that matter","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"(strict concurrency, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"type":"text","text":" inference, isolation checking) are exactly the ones"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that surface as errors only once someone tries."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"These values name both ends, so a build script or a compatibility note can report the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"range without hardcoding numbers that go stale.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"One-manifest-Swift-6-language-mode","text":"One manifest, Swift 6 language mode"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The package ships a single ","type":"text"},{"code":"Package.swift","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" at tools-version 6.2, and every target in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it is compiled in ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Swift 6 language mode","type":"text"}]},{"text":" — full strict-concurrency checking as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"errors. Through 1.1.x the floor was 5.9 and a second, version-specific manifest","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"code":"Package@swift-6.0.swift","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") carried the language mode for 6.x toolchains; with the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"floor at 6.2 every toolchain that can resolve the package reads the setting directly,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so that file is gone.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"VersionPolicyTests","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" asserts these values against the manifest and the CI matrix, so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"none of them can drift.","type":"text"}]}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SupportedVersions"},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"enum","title":"SupportedVersions","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SupportedVersions","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Enumeration","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SupportedVersions"}],"modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK17SupportedVersionsO"},"abstract":[{"text":"The range of Swift versions this SDK is built and tested ag